    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        310.6794128417969,
        489.1253356933594,
        323.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "We rated down two levels because the confidence intervals include appreciable harm and appreciable benefit: RR 1.26 (0.34 to 4.68) a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        319.6794128417969,
        463.12103271484375,
        332.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "We rated down one level because the confidence intervals include appreciable harm and some benefit. RR 0.53 (0.16 to 1.70) b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.6794128417969,
        707.0689697265625,
        341.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "Treatment completion in the levofloxacin arm was 86% in TB CHAMP (placebo arm: 86%) and 70% in VQUIN (placebo arm: 85%) – RRs 1.00 [95% CI 0.95 to 1.06] and 0.83 [0.79 to 0.87] respectively c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        337.6794128417969,
        786.9127807617188,
        350.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "We rated down one level for risk of bias. The results are not from a randomized comparison. In VQUIN, of the 43 persons with suspected TB post-randomization, 17 had a laboratory-confirmed incident TB, in 4 of whom an isolate  d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61419677734375,
        349.6794128417969,
        786.75146484375,
        359.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "could not be recovered. Results were only available for 8/13. Of these 6 were in the placebo group and 2 from the LFX arm. In TB CHAMP, 14 individuals in the placebo arm and 7 in the LFX arm developed TB, of which 7 and 3",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61419677734375,
        358.6794128417969,
        418.1879577636719,
        368.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "respectively with confirmed TB. No results for levofloxacin susceptibility were available for the strains isolated.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        364.6794128417969,
        477.6285400390625,
        377.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "We rated down one level for indirectness. Data was only available for VQUIN; all strains were from individuals aged over 15 years. e",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        376.6794128417969,
        363.8518981933594,
        386.2794189453125
      ],
      "text": "We rated down one level for imprecision due to the small number of samples and zero events. f",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
